  "editorReview": {
    "text": "The Arctic setting operates as a brilliant pressure system here; the sensory presence of cold creeping through walls effectively isolates the cast, while the forensic specificity of the eleven-minute tape gap and the tide-table alibi offers deeply satisfying, fair-play detection. The emotional core strikes hard in Chapter 12, where a crayon-cipher reveal repurposes childhood intimacy into a genuine investigative breakthrough. However, the prose occasionally suffers from rhythmic monotony, with an over-reliance on em-dashes and repetitive sentence openings that flatten the voice. The final act",
